          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 733870402,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The [User's Guide](https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsug_html_chunked/ChUsePacketBytesPaneSection.html) says changing with the Context Menu is Permanent, but 3.6.0rc3 does not seem to hold the setting.  \n  \nUpdate: documented in !2761 that this feature is not working.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
